><p dir="ltr"
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-14.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>Q14c: </span
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-11.3pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>This study demonstrated that 16 weeks of high-dose PA supplementation&#xD;was unable to increase skeletal muscle CoASH&#xD;content. Consequently, exercise metabolism and capacity were&#xD;unaltered in endurance trained cyclists.</span
></p
></body
